# Redaction Function Skills

This repository contains function-point Agent Skills in `.cursor/skills/`.

Use these skills when the user asks for a specific anonymization capability:

- Full image flow: `$redaction-anonymize-image-flow`
- OCR text result: `$redaction-image-ocr-result`
- OCR block normalization: `$redaction-ocr-block-normalize`
- Table/form recall: `$redaction-ocr-table-form-recall`
- Text entity recognition: `$redaction-text-ner-result`
- Entity-to-box mapping: `$redaction-ocr-entity-box-map`
- Visual region localization: `$redaction-visual-region-locate`
- Seal detection: `$redaction-seal-region-detect`
- QR/barcode detection: `$redaction-code-region-detect`
- Region deduplication: `$redaction-region-deduplicate`
- Mask plan generation: `$redaction-mask-plan-build`
- Image/PDF/DOCX/text rendering: `$redaction-mask-image-render`, `$redaction-mask-pdf-render`, `$redaction-mask-docx-render`, `$redaction-mask-text-render`
- Preview, compare, report: `$redaction-preview-image`, `$redaction-compare-version`, `$redaction-report-json`
- Batch flow: `$redaction-batch-job-create`, `$redaction-batch-recognize-run`, `$redaction-batch-review-draft`, `$redaction-batch-export-package`
- Structured data flow: `$redaction-structured-dataset-load`, `$redaction-structured-profile-columns`, `$redaction-structured-policy-build`, `$redaction-structured-export-run`
- Presets, model health, UI boxes, API examples: `$redaction-preset-scenario-build`, `$redaction-model-service-check`, `$redaction-ui-bbox-editor`, `$redaction-api-demo-call`

For end-to-end image anonymization, chain:

`$redaction-image-ocr-result` -> `$redaction-ocr-block-normalize` -> `$redaction-text-ner-result` -> `$redaction-ocr-entity-box-map` -> `$redaction-visual-region-locate` -> `$redaction-region-deduplicate` -> `$redaction-mask-plan-build` -> `$redaction-preview-image` or `$redaction-mask-image-render`.
